01:03:41,230 --> 01:03:49,668
运行代码，我们得到了“密码太弱”，这是正确的，因为 ABC123 只有 6 个字符。
Running the code, we got password is too weak, which is correct because ABC123 has only six characters.

628
01:03:50,510 --> 01:03:58,736
如果我们把密码改为更长的内容，比如 secure pass 2024 并再次运行，我们会得到：
If we change the password to something longer, like secure pass 2024 and run it again, we get password is

629
01:03:58,896 --> 01:04:01,252
“很强”，因为它有 14 个字符。
strong since it has 14 characters.

630
01:04:02,094 --> 01:04:04,496
