811
01:24:23,406 --> 01:24:32,036
当身高为52英寸且年龄为14岁时运行代码，结果是“你可以骑行”。两个条件都满足了。
Running the code with a height of 52 inches and an age of 14, we get you can ride. Both conditions are met.

812
01:24:32,878 --> 01:24:39,396
如果我们把高度改为45并再次运行，就会得到“抱歉”的消息。
If we change the height to 45 and run it again, we get the sorry message instead.

813
01:24:40,238 --> 01:24:44,676
虽然年龄仍然是14岁，但身高条件现在不成立了。
Even though the age is still 14, the height condition is now false.

814
01:24:45,518 --> 01:24:51,492
因为AND要求两边都为真，所以整个表达式的结果就是假。
Since AND requires both sides to be true, the whole expression evaluates to false.

