821
01:25:29,326 --> 01:25:37,668
这里，not is_raining反转了is_raining的值。所以只有当is_raining为假时，这部分才为真。
Here, not is raining flips the value of is raining. So this part is only true if is raining is false.

822
01:25:38,510 --> 01:25:48,580
结合and temperature >= 65，只有当两个条件都满足——没下雨且足够温暖时，整个表达式才为真。
Combined with and temperature greater than or equal to 65, the whole expression is true only when both hold, no rain and warm enough.

823
01:25:49,422 --> 01:25:53,668
如果条件成立，我们就打印“非常适合野餐”。
If the condition is true, we print great day for a picnic.

824
01:25:54,510 --> 01:26:00,548
对于elif块，我们想捕捉到天气不好的情况，比如下雨或气温过低。
For the LIF block, we want to catch the bad weather cases, rain or freezing temperatures.

825
01:26:01,390 --> 01:26:06,564
为此，我们写成is_raining or temperature < 32。
To do this, we write is raining or temperature less than 32.

826
01:26:07,406 --> 01:26:15,204
OR表达式只要有一边为真就成立，所以这能同时涵盖下雨天和严寒天气。
An OR expression is true when at least one side is true, so this catches both a rainy day and a freezing day.

827
01:26:16,046 --> 01:26:21,444
如果这个条件成立，我们就打印“待在室内，不适合出门”。
If this condition is true, we print stay indoors, not a great day to be outside.

828
01:26:22,256 --> 01:26:29,892
最后，else块处理剩下的情况，我们打印“天气还可以，可以去散个步”。
Finally, the else block handles the rest of the cases, where we print a decent enough day for a short walk.

829
01:26:31,502 --> 01:26:38,468
当温度为72且没下雨时运行代码，结果是“非常适合野餐”。
Running the code with a temperature of 72 and no rain, we get great day for a picnic.

