01:26:39,310 --> 01:26:45,764
如果我们把is_raining改为true并再次运行，就会得到“待在室内”的消息。
If we change is raining to true and run it again, we get the stay indoors message.

831
01:26:46,606 --> 01:26:52,804
而在温度为55且没下雨的情况下，我们得到“散步”的建议。
And with a temperature of 55 and no rain, we get the short walk recommendation.

