我们测试的大多数条件都是读取存储在单个变量中的值。当你有很多相关信息、必须创建很多个变量时，这样做就不太方便了。
Most of those conditions we tested read a value that's stored in a single variable. That works fine until you have lots of related information that you'd have to create lots of variables for.

834
01:27:13,376 --> 01:27:19,456
在下一节中，我们将看看如何使用一种叫做Python列表的数据类型来存储一系列相关信息。
In the next section, we'll see how to store collections of related information in a data type called Python lists.

835
01:27:20,270 --> 01:27:28,816
你的程序里是不是有很多相关的信息，目前正存放在多个变量里？这难道不显得乱糟糟且难以追踪吗？
Do your programs have a bunch of related information that you're currently storing in multiple variables? Isn't this messy and hard to track?

836
01:27:29,486 --> 01:27:39,620
当你有多条相关数据时，使用Python列表可以帮助你将它们组合在一个结构容器中，而不是分散在多个独立的变量里。
When you have multiple related pieces of data, using a Python list helps you group them together in one structure container instead of spreading them across multiple separate variables.

837
01:27:40,462 --> 01:27:43,236
让我们通过一个简单的例子来看看如何使用它们。
Let's see how to use them with a simple example.

838
01:27:44,078 --> 01:27:49,540
为了用列表存储朋友的名字，我们首先写一对方括号。
To store the names of our friends using a list, we start by writing a pair of square brackets.

839
01:27:50,382 --> 01:27:55,300
在这些括号之间，我们用逗号隔开每个朋友的名字。
Between these brackets, we write each friend's name separated by commas.

840
01:27:56,142 --> 01:27:57,028
就这样。
And that's it.

841
01:27:57,870 --> 01:28:01,412
运行这个单元格，我们成功创建了一个包含各项内容的列表。
Running the cell, we've successfully created a list of items.

842
01:28:02,254 --> 01:28:05,956
但如果我们想在以后使用这个列表，我们就需要把它存到某个地方。
But if we wanted to use this list later, we need to store it somewhere.

843
01:28:06,798 --> 01:28:13,636
为了保存这个列表，我们可以把它赋值给一个变量，比如叫 friends，就像处理数字或字符串一样。
To save our list, we can assign it to a variable, say friends, just like we would with a number or a string.

844
01:28:14,478 --> 01:28:20,708
如果我们 Print 这个变量并重新运行代码，就能看到它包含了我们朋友的名字。
If we print this variable and rerun the code, we can see that it contains the names of our friends.

845
01:28:21,326 --> 01:28:26,724
既然已经创建了列表，让我们看看如何利用它给 Nathan 发送一条生日快乐信息。
Now that we've created our list, let's see how to use it to print a happy birthday message to Nathan.

846
01:28:27,566 --> 01:28:31,460
为此，我们需要从 friends 列表中获取他的名字。
To do that, we need to access his name from the friends list.

847
01:28:32,302 --> 01:28:38,660
在 Python 中，我们可以通过位置来选择特定的项目，这也被称为它的索引。
In Python, we can select a specific item using its position, also called its index.

848
01:28:39,502 --> 01:28:45,572
注意，Python 的索引是从 0 开始，而不是从 1 开始，这起初可能感觉有点奇怪。
Note that Python indexes start at 0, not 1, which might feel a little strange at first.

849
01:28:46,414 --> 01:28:52,964
这意味着 Nathan 虽然是列表中的第三个人，但与之关联的索引是 2。
This means that the index associated with Nathan is 2, even though he is the third person in the list.

850
01:28:53,806 --> 01:29:01,892
所以要获取特定索引处的数值，我们必须写出列表名称，后面跟着包含索引的方括号。
So to access the value at a specific index, we must write the name of the list followed by square brackets that contain the index.

851
01:29:02,734 --> 01:29:09,380
在我们的例子中，为了获取 Nathan 的名字，我们写成 friends，方括号，2。
In our example, to access Nathan's name, we write friends, square brackets, 2.

852
01:29:10,222 --> 01:29:12,644
这个操作叫做索引。
This operation is called indexing.

853
01:29:13,486 --> 01:29:16,804
运行单元格，我们给 Nathan 打印出一条生日快乐信息。
Running the cell, we print a happy birthday message to Nathan.

854
01:29:17,614 --> 01:29:23,748
不过索引不仅限于获取数值，它还可以用来修改数值。
Indexing though is not limited to accessing values, it can also be used to modify values.

855
01:29:24,592 --> 01:29:29,412
例如，假设我们想用 Nate 这个别名来称呼我们的朋友 Nathan。
For example, suppose we want to refer to our friend Nathan by his nickname Nate.

856
01:29:30,254 --> 01:29:35,812
做到这一点，我们只需将索引为 2 的值重新赋值为 Nate。
To do this, we can simply reassign the value at index 2 to Nate.

857
01:29:36,654 --> 01:29:41,444
再次运行单元格，我们可以看到 Nathan 这个值已经更新成了 Nate。
Running the cell again, we can see that the value Nathan has been updated to Nate.

858
01:29:42,286 --> 01:29:47,908
获取单个项目很好，但有时我们想一次性选择多个项目。
Accessing a single item is great, but sometimes we want to select multiple items at once.

859
01:29:48,750 --> 01:29:54,468
例如，假设我们正在筹划一个小型派对，只想邀请 Paul 和 Dana。
For example, suppose we're planning a small party and we only want to invite Paul and Dana.

860
01:29:55,310 --> 01:30:03,428
与其一个一个去索引每一个人，Python 提供了一个叫切片的快捷方式，让我们能获取列表的一部分。
Instead of indexing each person one by one, Python gives us a shortcut called slicing, which lets us grab parts of a list.

861
01:30:04,238 --> 01:30:13,572
要从某个索引到另一个索引切分列表，我们在括号中写下起始索引，接着是一个冒号，然后是结束索引。
To slice a list from some index to another, we write the starting index, followed by a colon, and the ending index in between brackets.

862
01:30:14,382 --> 01:30:20,804
注意在 Python 中，结束索引不包含在切片内，但起始索引是包含在内的。
Note that in Python, the ending index is excluded from the slice, but the starting index is included.

863
01:30:21,582 --> 01:30:30,352
例如，要获取包含 Paul 和 Dana 的朋友列表切片，我们将 0 作为起始索引
For example, to get the slice of the friend's list containing Paul and Dana, we write 0 as the start index

864
01:30:30,592 --> 01:30:32,740
并将 2 作为停止索引。
and 2 as the stop index.

865
01:30:33,550 --> 01:30:37,700
运行代码后，我们得到了前两个名字：Paul 和 Dana。
Running the code, we get the first two names, Paul and Dana.

866
01:30:38,542 --> 01:30:44,644
我们也可以从列表中间开始切片。也许这次我们想邀请 Dana 和 Nathan。
We can also slice from the middle of the list. Maybe this time we want to invite Dana and Nathan.

867
01:30:45,486 --> 01:30:50,116
为此，我们从索引 1 开始，在索引 3 之前停止。
To do that, we start at index 1 and stop right before index 3.

868
01:30:50,958 --> 01:30:55,204
运行单元格，我们可以看到它准确地打印出这两个名字。
Running the cell, we can see that it prints exactly those two names.

869
01:30:56,112 --> 01:31:01,412
如果我们还想邀请 Lily，可以将结束索引更新为 4。
And if we also wanted to invite Lily, we could update the end index to 4.

870
01:31:02,254 --> 01:31:09,508
这看起来可能有点奇怪，因为列表中没有索引 4，但请记住结束索引是不包含在内的。
This might look strange since there's no index 4 in the list, but remember the ending index is excluded.

871
01:31:10,318 --> 01:31:13,392
运行代码后，我们的切片现在包含了 Lily。
Running the code, our slice now contains Lily.

872
01:31:14,350 --> 01:31:21,572
注意，当获取包含列表末尾的切片时，我们也可以省略结束索引。
Note that when retrieving a slice that includes the end of the list, we can also leave out the ending index.

873
01:31:22,414 --> 01:31:25,124
这种语法是一种方便的简写。
This syntax is a convenient shorthand.

874
01:31:25,934 --> 01:31:30,244
Python 列表的另一个便捷功能是负数索引。
Another convenient feature of Python lists is negative indexing.

875
01:31:31,086 --> 01:31:39,008
负数索引从列表末尾开始计数，所以 -1 指的是最后一个项目，-2 是它前面的那个，
Negative indexes count from the end of the list, so negative one refers to the last item, negative two to the one before it,

876
01:31:39,248 --> 01:31:40,068
以此类推。
and so on.

877
01:31:40,942 --> 01:31:48,928
所以如果我们想再次邀请 Dana 和 Nathan，我们可以指定起始索引为负三，
So if we want to again invite Dana and Nathan, we can specify the start index negative three and the stop index

878
01:31:49,088 --> 01:31:49,924
停止索引为负一。
negative one.

879
01:31:50,766 --> 01:31:53,380
运行单元格后，我们得到了这两个名字。
Running the cell, we get those two names.

880
01:31:54,222 --> 01:32:02,564
太棒了！索引和切片让我们能访问列表的部分内容，但列表在创建后也可以修改。
Awesome! Indexing and slicing let us access parts of a list, but lists can also be modified after they're created.

881
01:32:03,408 --> 01:32:08,260
例如，我们可能想添加一个新朋友，或者移除一个搬走的。
For example, we might want to add a new friend or remove one who moved away.

882
01:32:09,102 --> 01:32:18,148
为此，Python 为我们提供了列表方法，这些是让我们轻松添加、移除和重新排列项目的内置工具。
To do this, Python gives us list methods, which are built-in tools that let us easily add, remove, and rearrange items.

