1113
01:54:29,870 --> 01:54:34,212
程序员通常把这个变量称为循环或迭代变量。
Programmers often call this variable the loop or iteration variable.

1114
01:54:35,054 --> 01:54:41,924
在循环执行过程中，这个变量会按顺序被分配到我们想要遍历的集合中的每一个项目。
During the execution of the loop, this variable will be sequentially assigned each item in the collection we want to iterate through.

1115
01:54:42,798 --> 01:54:48,228
由于这个迭代变量将持有单个价格值，让我们把它重命名为 price。
Since this iteration variable will hold individual price values, let's rename it price.

1116
01:54:49,102 --> 01:54:52,976
接下来，在迭代变量后面加上 in 关键字。
Next, we follow the iteration variable with the keyword in.

1117
01:54:53,966 --> 01:55:00,612
in 关键字将我们的循环变量与我们想要循环的列表连接起来。在这种情况下，就是 prices。
The in keyword connects our loop variable to the list we want to loop through. In this case, prices.

1118
01:55:01,518 --> 01:55:05,412
最后，我们用冒号完成 for 循环的第一行。
Finally, we complete the first line of our for loop with a colon.

1119
01:55:06,254 --> 01:55:08,804
第一行被称为 for 循环头。
This first line is called the for loop header.

1120
01:55:09,646 --> 01:55:13,220
在头部下方，我们编写缩进代码，这些代码将为每个项目运行一次。
Below the header, we write indented code that will run for each item.

1121
01:55:14,222 --> 01:55:16,708
对于每一个价格，我们应用折扣
For each price, we apply the discount

1122
01:55:17,614 --> 01:55:19,268
并打印折后的数值。
and print the discounted value.

1123
01:55:20,110 --> 01:55:23,076
这个缩进块被称为循环体。
This indented block is called the loop body.

1124
01:55:23,982 --> 01:55:26,500
就这样搞定！我们的 for 循环完成了。
And that's it! Our for loop is complete.

1125
01:55:27,342 --> 01:55:31,556
现在让我们来看看当单元格运行时，Python 将如何执行这个循环。
Now let's walk through how Python will execute this loop when the cell is run.

1126
01:55:32,430 --> 01:55:37,444
首先，Python 执行 for 循环头并创建循环变量 price。
First, Python executes the for loop header and creates the loop variable price.

1127
01:55:38,286 --> 01:55:47,076
由于这是循环的第一次迭代，Python 将 prices 列表中的第一个项目 1299 分配给 price 变量。
Since this is the first iteration of the loop, Python assigns the first item in the prices list, 1299, to the price variable.

1128
01:55:47,950 --> 01:55:57,252
然后 Python 进入循环体，计算 1299 乘以 0.9，并打印结果 11.691。
Python then enters the loop body, calculates 1299 times 0.9, and prints the result 11.691.

1129
01:55:58,094 --> 01:56:01,956
由于循环体内没有更多行了，Python 返回到头部。
Since there are no more lines in the body, Python returns to the header.

1130
01:56:02,830 --> 01:56:10,496
现在，这里发生的情况很重要。price 变量被重新分配为列表中的下一个值，$1599。
Now, what happens here is important. The price variable is reassigned to the next value in the list, $1599.

1131
01:56:11,342 --> 01:56:19,396
Python 再次进入循环体，计算 $15.99 乘以 0.9，并打印 14.391。
Python enters the loop body again, calculates $15.99 times 0.9, and prints 14.391.

1132
01:56:20,238 --> 01:56:24,036
只要还有更多价格需要打折，这个模式就会继续下去。
This pattern continues as long as there are more prices to discount.

1133
01:56:24,878 --> 01:56:28,096
Python 处理第三个价格，$7.99。
Python processes the third price, $7.99.

1134
01:56:30,606 --> 01:56:33,092
然后是第四个价格，$27.99。
Then the fourth price, $27.99.

1135
01:56:35,950 --> 01:56:42,724
在第四次迭代后，Python 返回到头部，但发现列表中没有更多项目了，所以它退出循环。
After the fourth iteration, Python returns to the header but finds no more items in the list, so it exits the loop.

1136
01:56:43,566 --> 01:56:48,260
由于循环后没有未缩进的代码行，程序结束。
Since there are no unindented lines of code after the loop, the program ends.

1137
01:56:49,198 --> 01:56:54,180
但如果还有更多代码行，Python 将继续执行那些内容。
But if there were more lines of code, Python would move on to executing those.

1138
01:56:55,054 --> 01:56:57,316
为了确认这一点，让我们运行一下代码。
To confirm this, let's run our code.

1139
01:56:58,158 --> 01:57:02,660
太棒了！我们在循环中计算出的折后价格与预期输出一致。
Great! The discounted prices calculated in our loop match the expected output.

1140
01:57:03,534 --> 01:57:12,804
此外，请注意缩进的代码被执行了四次，每个价格一次，而循环后的代码只执行了一次。
In addition, notice that the indented code was executed four times, once per price, while the code after the loop was executed only once.

1141
01:57:13,646 --> 01:57:19,396
好了，让我们通过对比手动操作的方法，来看看 for循环为我们做了什么。
Alright, let's take stock of what our for loop has done for us by comparing it to our manual approach.

1142
01:57:20,238 --> 01:57:25,732
最初，我们把折扣计算写了四次，每个价格对应一次。
Originally, we wrote the discounted calculations four separate times, one for each price.

1143
01:57:26,606 --> 01:57:33,636
使用 for循环，我们只需要写一次折价操作，但 Python 就执行了四次。
Using a for loop, we only had to write the discounting operation once, yet Python executed it four times.

1144
01:57:34,510 --> 01:57:37,668
现在想象一下，如果我们的列表里有一千个价格。
Now imagine if our list was a thousand prices.

1145
01:57:38,510 --> 01:57:41,988
手动操作的方法需要写 1000 行代码。
The manual approach would require 1,000 lines of code.

1146
01:57:42,830 --> 01:57:45,700
但 for循环呢？仍然只需要两行。
But the for loop? Still just two lines.

1147
01:57:46,574 --> 01:57:50,980
这个循环可以自动扩展，用来给列表中的任意数量的商品打折。
The loop automatically scales to discount any number of items in the list.

1148
01:57:51,886 --> 01:57:57,732
太棒了！到目前为止，我们已经学习了如何基于现有的物品列表来构建 for循环。
Awesome! So far we've seen how to build a for loop based on an existing list of items.

1149
01:57:58,574 --> 01:58:03,844
但有时我们只是需要重复某个动作，而并没有现成的列表可以利用。
But sometimes we simply need to repeat an action and don't have a list to build from.

1150
01:58:04,686 --> 01:58:09,764
这在 Python 中也是可以实现的。让我们通过另一个例子来看看。
This is also something we can do in Python. Let's see how with a different example.

1151
