假设你正在组织一场抽奖活动，需要打印编号从 0 到 5 的门票。
Imagine you're organizing a raffle and need to print tickets numbered 0 through 5.

1152
01:58:16,302 --> 01:58:20,900
为了制作这些门票，我们可以先创建一个包含这些数字的列表
To create these tickets, we could begin by creating a list with those numbers

1153
01:58:22,734 --> 01:58:25,700
然后接一个遍历该列表的循环。
and follow up with a loop that iterates through that list.

1154
01:58:26,624 --> 01:58:26,784
对于
For

1155
01:58:27,904 --> 01:58:36,384
门票编号列表中的每一个门票号码，我们先打印“萨默 Super Raffle”这段文字，
each ticket number in the ticket numbers list, we first print the text Summer Super Raffle,

1156
01:58:36,544 --> 01:58:38,020
接着是门票号码。
followed by the ticket number.

1157
01:58:40,046 --> 01:58:46,724
注意我们的循环体现在有两行代码。在每次迭代中，Python 都会执行这两行。
Notice our loop body now has two lines of code. During each iteration, Python will execute both lines.

1158
01:58:47,566 --> 01:58:51,428
运行这段代码，Python 确实打印出了我们想要的抽奖门票。
Running this code, Python indeed prints the raffle tickets we wanted.

1159
01:58:52,334 --> 01:58:56,996
这可行，但假设我们想要一百张抽奖门票，而不仅仅是六张。
This works, but imagine we wanted a hundred raffle tickets instead of just six.

1160
01:58:57,838 --> 01:59:02,372
我们就得手动输入所有这些数字了。这看起来工作量很大。
We would need to manually type out all of those numbers. Seems like a lot of work.

1161
01:59:03,214 --> 01:59:08,004
幸运的是，Python 有一个内置函数可以帮我们生成连续的数字。
Luckily, Python has a built-in function that can generate sequential numbers for us.

1162
01:59:08,846 --> 01:59:11,268
这个内置函数叫 range。
This built-in function is called range.

1163
01:59:12,110 --> 01:59:13,412
这就是我们如何使用它的。
Here's how we can use it.

1164
01:59:14,350 --> 01:59:22,852
与其手动创建一个数字列表并遍历它，我们可以调用 range 函数并将 6 作为参数传入。
Instead of manually creating a list of numbers and iterating through it, we can call the range function and pass in a 6 as an argument.

1165
01:59:23,726 --> 01:59:30,564
这个 range 函数调用告诉 Python 从 0 开始生成数字，并在到达 6 之前停止。
This range function call tells Python to generate numbers starting from 0 and to stop right before 6.

1166
01:59:31,438 --> 01:59:37,060
运行代码后，我们得到和之前一样的门票，但这种新方法可以轻松扩展。
Running the code, we get the same ticket as before, but this new approach can scale easily.

1167
01:59:37,934 --> 01:59:46,212
例如，如果我们把 106 传给 range 函数，range 函数就会生成编号从 0
For example, if we instead pass 106 into the range function, the range function generates tickets with numbers 0

1168
01:59:47,424 --> 01:59:48,704
到 105 的门票
to 105

1169
01:59:49,984 --> 01:59:52,452
而我们不需要做任何额外的工作。
without any extra work on our end.

1170
01:59:53,294 --> 01:59:57,220
注意，range 函数默认从 0 开始生成数字。
Note that the range function starts generating numbers from 0 by default.

1171
01:59:58,062 --> 02:00:03,844
不过，如果我们想更改这个下界，可以将其作为第一个参数指定。
However, if we want to change this lower bound, we can specify it as the first argument.

1172
02:00:04,686 --> 02:00:13,504
例如，如果我们要让抽奖券的编号在 1000 到 1005 之间，我们可以调用 range 函数并传入 1000
For example, if we want our raffle tickets to be numbered between 1000 and 1005, we can call the range function passing 1000

1173
02:00:13,664 --> 02:00:16,068
和 1006 作为参数。
and 1006 as arguments.

1174
02:00:16,910 --> 02:00:20,864
运行代码后，我们得到了从 1000 到 1005 的票号。
Running the code, we get tickets from 1000 to 1005.

1175
02:00:21,742 --> 02:00:30,372
就是这样！在这一段视频中，你已经学会了如何构建 for循环，无论是遍历现有列表还是使用 range 函数来重复执行操作。
And that's it! In this video, you've learned how to build for loops, both to iterate through existing lists and to repeat actions using the range function.

1176
02:00:31,424 --> 02:00:35,584
