价格乘以（1 减去折扣）。
Price multiplied by one minus the discount.

1211
02:03:23,950 --> 02:03:27,332
运行这个单元格，每个价格都会产生两行输出。
Running the cell, for each price we get two lines of output.

1212
02:03:27,792 --> 02:03:30,820
