The original price, then the discounted price right below it.

1213
02:03:31,758 --> 02:03:34,308
循环体里的这两行代码会在每一次迭代中都运行。
Both lines in the body run on every single iteration.

1214
02:03:35,246 --> 02:03:37,508
太棒了，这三个问题就全部搞定了。
