1274
02:08:56,718 --> 02:08:58,084
但问题来了。
But here's the problem.

1275
02:08:59,118 --> 02:09:03,748
默认情况下，for循环一次只能遍历一个列表。
By default, a for loop can only iterate through one list at a time.

1276
02:09:04,640 --> 02:09:06,400
那我们怎么打印报告呢？
So how can we print a report?

1277
02:09:07,438 --> 02:09:12,292
同时配对多个列表中的项目是编程中非常常见的需求。
Pairing items from multiple lists at once is a very common need in programming.

1278
02:09:13,264 --> 02:09:17,508
非常常见，以至于 Python 有一种内置的方法来处理它，就是 zip 函数。
So common that Python has a built-in way to do it, the zip function.

1279
02:09:18,382 --> 02:09:21,412
要使用这个函数，我们直接在循环头中调用它。
To use the function, we call it right in our loop header.

1280
02:09:22,350 --> 02:09:27,972
在这个调用中，我们传入想要配对的两个列表：学生和他们的成绩。
Into that call, we pass the two lists we want to pair, students and their scores.

1281
02:09:28,814 --> 02:09:35,076
由于我们目前还不知道 zip 在每次迭代中会生成什么，让我们把循环变量 X 重命名。
Since we don't yet know what zip will generate on each iteration, let's rename our loop variable X.

1282
02:09:36,046 --> 02:09:38,372
为了看看 X 是什么，我们将它打印出来。
To see what X is, we'll print it.

1283
02:09:39,278 --> 02:09:44,548
运行代码，我们看到 zip 生成了由学生和成绩组成的配对。
Running the code, we see that zip produces pairs of students and grades.

1284
02:09:45,518 --> 02:09:47,300
这些配对被称为元组。
These pairs are called tuples.

1285
02:09:48,302 --> 02:09:55,492
