1326
02:13:32,590 --> 02:13:38,532
但如果你只是合并几个已知长度相同的列表，用 zip 是个很棒的选择。
But if you're just combining a few lists, and you know they're the same length, zip is a great choice.

1327
02:13:39,406 --> 02:13:39,904
太棒了！
Awesome!

1328
02:13:40,142 --> 02:13:43,908
到现在为止，你应该已经能熟练使用 zip 来配对多个列表了。
By now you should feel comfortable using zip to pair lists together.

1329
02:13:44,814 --> 02:13:46,244
但这并不是唯一的方法。
But it's not the only way.

1330
02:13:47,182 --> 02:13:53,860
尤其是在旧代码中，你会看到同样的操作是通过 range 和长度来遍历索引完成的。
Especially in older code, you'll see the same job done by looping over the indexes with range and length.

1331
02:13:54,894 --> 02:13:59,812
然后，为了获取列表项，代码必须使用手动索引。
Then, to access the list items, the code has to use manual indexing.

1332
02:14:00,718 --> 02:14:04,356
这种方法可行，而且产出的结果是一样的。
This does work, and it produces the same output.

1333
02:14:05,198 --> 02:14:11,236
但正如我们之前讨论过的，使用手动索引会让循环更难阅读，且更容易出错。
But as we discussed earlier, using manual indexing makes the loop harder to read and more error prone.

1334
02:14:12,142 --> 02:14:15,332
所以如果你看到这样的代码，请选择用 zip 来代替。
So if you find code like this, reach for zip instead.

1335
02:14:16,238 --> 02:14:19,588
这是同时遍历多个列表最清晰、最安全的方法。
It's the clearest and safest way to loop through several lists at once.

1336
02:14:20,784 --> 02:14:26,468
太棒了！现在我们知道如何利用 zip 和 enumerate 函数来优化 for循环处理列表的方式了。
Awesome! Now we know how to use the zip and enumerate functions to improve how for loops work with lists.

1337
02:14:26,784 --> 02:14:35,584
