1473
02:27:47,118 --> 02:27:48,996
如果相等，就打印一条消息。
and print a message if it is.

1474
02:27:49,934 --> 02:27:50,336
太棒了！
Awesome!

1475
02:27:50,670 --> 02:27:53,508
我们的循环确认了 Alex 在联系人中。
Our loop confirms that Alex is in our contacts.

1476
