1480
02:28:20,782 --> 02:28:27,876
为了检查 ilovebunnies at gmail.com 是否在我们的联系人中，我们写一个遍历所有值的 for循环。
To check if iLovunnies at gmail.com is in our contacts, we write a for loop that iterates through the values.

1481
02:28:28,910 --> 02:28:36,068
在每次迭代中，我们将值与 ilovebunnies at gmail.com 进行比较，如果匹配就打印一条消息。
During each iteration, we compare the value to ilovunnies at gmail.com and print a message if it matches.

1482
02:28:37,038 --> 02:28:37,376
很好！
Great!

1483
02:28:37,742 --> 02:28:43,396
我们的循环确认了 ilovebunnies at gmail.com 是我们联系人中的一封邮件。
Our loop confirms that iLovunnies at gmail.com is an email in our contacts.

