and then the capital city as a string.

1500
02:30:30,094 --> 02:30:32,484
每对数据之间用逗号隔开。
Each pair is separated by a comma.

1501
02:30:33,326 --> 02:30:37,412
为了稍后使用这个字典，我们将它赋值给变量 capitals。
To use this dictionary later, we'll sign it to the variable capitals.

1502
02:30:38,254 --> 02:30:47,632
字典设置好后，我们可以通过输入字典名称并加上键 Japan 来查找日本的首都，
With the dictionary set up, we can search it for the capital city of Japan by writing the name of the dictionary, followed by the key Japan,

1503
02:30:48,032 --> 02:30:49,412
然后打印出结果。
and printing the result.

