1517
02:32:15,022 --> 02:32:19,364
在这个问题中，我们有一个包含五个学生及其考试成绩的字典。
In this problem, we're given a dictionary of five students and their test scores.

1518
02:32:20,206 --> 02:32:23,972
我们需要使用 keys 方法打印出所有学生的名字。
We need to print all the students' names using the keys method.

1519
02:32:24,782 --> 02:32:30,628
之后，我们需要使用 items 方法只打印出得分超过 80 的学生。
After that, we need to use the items method to print only the students who scored above 80.

1520
02:32:31,822 --> 02:32:33,860
让我们先从打印学生名字开始。
Let's start with printing students' names.

1521
02:32:34,702 --> 02:32:42,980
由于名字是字典中的键，我们可以使用 keys 方法将这些名字获取为列表，并使用循环来遍历它们。
Since the names are the keys in our dictionary, we can use the keys method to get the names as a list, and use a loop to iterate through them.

1522
02:32:43,822 --> 02:32:47,044
然后，在循环内部，我们可以打印出每个名字。
Then, inside the loop, we can print each name.

1523
02:32:48,878 --> 02:32:57,540
对于第二个任务，即只打印得分超过 80 的学生，我们需要输出学生的姓名和他们的分数。
For the second task, printing only the students who scored above an 80, we need to output both the name of the student and their score.

1524
02:32:58,382 --> 02:33:07,556
为了获取字典中每个条目的键和值，我们需要使用 items 方法，它将每个键值对作为元组返回。
To get both the key and the value for each entry in the dictionary, we need to use the items method, which returns each key value pair as a tuple.

1525
02:33:08,398 --> 02:33:14,020
然后我们可以使用循环将每个元组解包成独立的 name 和 score 变量。
We can then use a loop to unpack each tuple into separate name and score variables.

1526
02:33:14,862 --> 02:33:18,756
在循环内部，我们检查每个分数是否大于 80。
Inside the loop, we check if each score is greater than 80.

1527
02:33:19,566 --> 02:33:23,812
如果是，我们就使用 F string 打印出名字和分数。
If it is, we print the name and score using an F string.

1528
02:33:24,654 --> 02:33:28,580
如果你想了解更多关于 F strings 的信息，请查看我们在描述中提供的链接视频。
If you want to learn more about F strings, check out our video linked in the description.

1529
02:33:30,702 --> 02:33:35,332
运行单元格后，我们得到了由 keys 方法生成的学生名字。
Running the cell, we get all the students' names produced by the keys method.

1530
02:33:36,256 --> 02:33:43,300
而在名字之后，我们只得到了得分超过 80 的学生：Alice、Carol 和 Eve。
And, after the names, we get only the students who scored more than 80. Alice, Carol, and Eve.

1531
02:33:44,142 --> 02:33:52,100
使用 items 方法让我们能在单个循环中同时处理键和值，这在处理真实数据时是常见的需求。
Using the items method lets us work with both keys and values in a single loop, which is a common need when you're working with real data.

1532
02:33:52,816 --> 02:33:58,096
现在我们可以把数据存入字典，并了解如何操作字典中的键值对。
Now we can store data in a dictionary and understand how to work with the dictionary's key-value pairs.

1533
02:33:58,256 --> 02:34:05,616
但是这些键值对以及程序处理的所有其他数据，在程序运行前就已经定义好了。
But those key value pairs, along with all the other data our program has worked with, has been defined before the program was run.

1534
02:34:05,936 --> 02:34:13,540
在下一节中，我们将学习如何获取用户输入，这样就不需要在程序运行前定义每一项数据了。
In the next section, we'll learn how to use user input so that we don't need to define every single piece of data before the program runs.

1535
02:34:14,382 --> 02:34:19,748
想让你的 Python 程序更具交互性吗？获取用户输入是关键。
Want to make your Python programs more interactive? Asking users for input is the key.

1536
02:34:20,398 --> 02:34:26,180
看完这个视频后，你就会知道如何请求输入，同时避免初学者常犯的错误。
After watching this video, you'll know exactly how to ask for input while avoiding a common beginner mistake.

1537
02:34:27,502 --> 02:34:34,980
为了熟悉语法，我们将编写一个简单的程序，要求用户输入姓名并输出一条定制的问候信息。
To get familiar with the syntax, we'll write the code for this simple program that asks for a user's name and outputs a customized greeting message.

1538
02:34:36,462 --> 02:34:40,452
在 Python 中，获取用户输入最简单的方法是调用 input 函数。
In Python, the easiest way to get user input is to call the input function.

1539
02:34:41,454 --> 02:34:44,740
为了了解 input 函数的作用，让我们运行这个单元格。
To understand what the input function does, let's run the cell.

1540
02:34:45,742 --> 02:34:49,476
如你所见，函数调用在单元格下方创建了一个输入框。
As you can see, the function call created an input box under the cell.

1541
02:34:50,382 --> 02:34:54,532
此时，程序正在等待用户在框中输入信息。
At this point, the program is waiting for the user to enter information in the box.

1542
02:34:55,278 --> 02:34:59,300
这没问题，但如果没有更多上下文，用户很难知道该输入什么。
This is fine, but without more context, it's hard for a user to know what to input.

1543
02:35:00,238 --> 02:35:05,348
为了提示用户输入特定内容，我们可以将一段消息作为参数传递给函数。
To prompt the user for a specific input, we can provide a message as an argument to the function.

1544
02:35:06,126 --> 02:35:10,308
既然我们想让用户输入姓名，我们就传入字符串 enter your name。
Since we want the user to enter their name, let's pass the string enter your name.

1545
02:35:11,278 --> 02:35:15,300
现在当我们运行单元格时，提示信息会显示在输入框之前。
Now when we run the cell, our prompt is displayed before the input box.

1546
02:35:16,270 --> 02:35:17,156
清晰多了。
Much clearer.

1547
02:35:18,158 --> 02:35:22,916
一旦用户输入姓名并按回车，输入内容就会显示在输出框中。
Once the user inputs their name and presses enter, the input is displayed in the output box.

1548
02:35:23,918 --> 02:35:29,028
这没问题，但别忘了，我们的程序应该通过打印 hello 并加上他们的名字来问候用户。
That's fine, but remember, our program should greet the user by printing hello followed by their name.

1549
02:35:30,030 --> 02:35:35,620
为了创建问候信息，我们先将 input 函数的返回值保存到名为 name 的变量中。
To create our greeting message, we'll first save the return value of the input function to a variable called name.

1550
02:35:36,686 --> 02:35:40,516
然后，我们写一个打印语句，输出 hello 后接上 name。
Then we'll write a print statement that outputs hello followed by name.

1551
02:35:41,454 --> 02:35:44,772
现在当我们运行单元格时，系统会提示用户输入他们的姓名
Now when we run the cell, the user is prompted to enter their name

1552
02:35:45,422 --> 02:35:47,140
并且打印出定制的问候语。
and the custom greeting is printed.

1553
02:35:48,174 --> 02:35:48,576
太棒了！
Great!

1554
02:35:48,878 --> 02:35:54,660
在这个程序中，我们要求用户输入文本，但我们也可以使用 input 函数来请求数字。
In this program, we ask the user to input text, but we can also use the input function to ask for numbers.

1555
02:35:55,598 --> 02:35:59,908
然而，在请求数字输入时，初学者经常犯一个常见的错误。
However, when asking for numeric input, beginners often make a common mistake.

1556
02:36:00,878 --> 02:36:04,356
让我们看看那个错误是什么，以及如何通过另一个例子来避免它。
Let's see what that mistake is and how to avoid it with another example.

1557
02:36:05,358 --> 02:36:08,196
这个新程序将要求用户提供两个数字
This new program will ask the users for two numbers

1558
02:36:10,656 --> 02:36:11,428
并将它们相加。
add them up.

1559
02:36:13,390 --> 02:36:21,456
例如，要计算 1 加 2，我们运行单元格并输入 1 和 2，结果是 12？
For example, to add 1 and 2, we run the cell and enter 1 and 2 as inputs and get 12?

1560
02:36:22,478 --> 02:36:24,576
嗯，这并不是我们预期的结果。
Hmm, that's not what we expected.

1561
02:36:25,614 --> 02:36:26,576
为什么会这样？
Why did this happen?

1562
02:36:27,534 --> 02:36:32,132
之所以得到 12，是因为 input 函数总是把用户的输入作为字符串返回。
We got 12 because the input function always returns the user's input as a string.

1563
02:36:33,134 --> 02:36:37,572
所以加号运算符只是把两个变量拼接在了一起，而不是进行加法运算。
So the plus operator concatenated the two variables instead of adding them.

1564
02:36:38,606 --> 02:36:42,692
我们可以通过使用 type 函数来确认这些变量是字符串。
We can confirm that these variables are strings by using the type function.

1565
02:36:44,334 --> 02:36:45,860
数字 1 是一个字符串。
Number one is a string.

1566
02:36:46,862 --> 02:36:52,004
幸运的是，以字符串形式表示的数字总是可以转换成整数或浮点数。
Luckily, numbers represented as strings can always be converted to integers or floats.

1567
02:36:52,942 --> 02:37:00,036
为了避免处理错误的数据类型，良好的编程习惯是立即将用户输入转换为我们期望的数据类型。
To avoid working with data of the wrong type, it's good programming practice to immediately cast user inputs to the data type we expect.

1568
02:37:01,038 --> 02:37:06,084
