但现在这三个条形全都连在了一起，导致直方图依然很难阅读。
but the three bars now all blend together, which still makes the histogram hard to read.

2351
03:51:27,758 --> 03:51:31,556
为了解决这个问题，我们还可以给 hist 函数传递另外两个参数。
To fix that, there are two more arguments we can pass to the hist function.

2352
03:51:32,622 --> 03:51:38,244
第一个是 边缘颜色 参数，它允许我们指定条形之间的边界颜色。
First is the edge color argument, which allows us to specify a border color between the bars.

2353
03:51:39,086 --> 03:51:44,324
第二个是 对齐 参数，它能让条形在 x轴上保持对齐。
Second is the align argument, which keeps the bars consistently aligned on the x-axis.

2354
03:51:45,230 --> 03:51:47,108
在这些修改下运行单元格，
Running the cell with these changes,

2355
03:51:47,822 --> 03:51:49,604
现在条形清晰地分开了，
the bars are now cleanly separated,

2356
03:51:50,576 --> 03:51:53,924
而且条形也正好居中在它们对应的数字上方。
and the bars are centered over the numbers they correspond to.

2357
03:51:54,413 --> 03:51:56,313
也就是 3、4 和 5。
3, 4, and 5.

2358
03:51:57,518 --> 03:52:01,508
但 x轴上仍然有一些烦人的半天刻度标记。
But we still have the pesky half day tick marks cluttering up our x-axis.

2359
03:52:02,350 --> 03:52:03,524
为了去掉这些，
To get rid of those,

2360
03:52:04,416 --> 03:52:07,908
我们需要调用 plt.xticks 函数。
we need to call the plt.x ticks function.

2361
03:52:08,942 --> 03:52:12,996
这个函数接收一个数字列表，并严格使用这些数字作为标签。
This function takes a list of numbers and uses exactly those as labels.

2362
03:52:13,870 --> 03:52:18,916
我们再次使用 range 来构建那个列表，同样从最小休息天数开始，
We build that list using range again, starting at min rest days just like before,

2363
03:52:19,950 --> 03:52:28,452
但这次我们在最大休息天数加一处停止，而不是加二，因为我们是给每一天标注标签，而不是标记条形的结束位置。
but this time we stop at max rest days plus one, not plus two, since we're labeling each day itself rather than marking where the bar ends.

2364
03:52:29,422 --> 03:52:36,548
再运行一次单元格，x轴现在只显示 3、4 和 5，没有其他内容了。
Running the cell once more, the x-axis now shows exactly 3, 4, and 5, and nothing else.

2365
03:52:37,454 --> 03:52:39,588
直方图终于变得易于阅读了。
The histogram is finally easy to read.

2366
03:52:40,142 --> 03:52:44,100
条形宽度、边界和标签都与我们的数据对齐了。
The bar width, the borders, and the labels all line up with our data.

2367
03:52:45,070 --> 03:52:48,740
为了让图表尽可能清晰，我们还会给它加一个标题
To make our chart as clear as possible, we'll also give it a title

2368
03:52:50,414 --> 03:52:52,068
并标注两个轴。
and label both axes.

2369
03:52:54,094 --> 03:52:58,276
最后运行一次单元格，我们就得到了最终的直方图。
Running the cell one last time, we get our finished histogram.

2370
03:52:59,214 --> 03:53:04,260
在三天和四天处有两个高条形，而在五天处只有一个较短的条形。
Two tall bars stand at three and four days, with just a single shorter bar at five.

2371
03:53:05,262 --> 03:53:07,364
这意味着我们跑得不够频繁。
That means we didn't run frequently enough.

2372
03:53:08,302 --> 03:53:12,996
大部分休息期都在三到四天，甚至有一段间隔达到了五天。
Most of our rests landed three or four days, with one gap even stretching to five.

2373
03:53:13,966 --> 03:53:17,892
所以进入下一个训练周期时，我们要确保更频繁地跑步。
So heading into our next training block, we'll make sure to run more often.

